 "summary": "SMPlayer is a free, open-source Qt front end for mpv and MPlayer that remembers settings per file. It offers a classic player UI with skins, YouTube playback, opensubtitles.org downloads, filters and a configurable shortcut editor.",
 "where_it_wins": [
  "Resumes every file with its own settings (audio, subtitles, position)",
  "YouTube playback and online subtitle download",
  "Saved playlists, favorites, TV/radio lists",
  "Skins and icon themes, 30+ languages",
  "Runs on Windows and Linux too"
 ],
 "where_schnellbild_wins": [
  "Native macOS app; SMPlayer is a Qt port with unsigned, non-notarized DMGs",
  "Shows photos too, in one grid with videos",
  "Folder browser with thumbnails instead of a playlist",
  "Archives and comics as folders",
  "File sorting with two panes and undo",
  "No network access, App Sandbox"
 ],
